    <script type="application/ld+json">{"mainEntity":{"headline":"Current Advances and Prospects in Europium Wastewater Treatment: Health-environmental Issues, Innovative Technologies, and Composite-based Solutions","description":"The increasing use of europium (Eu), a critical rare-earth element (REE), in light-emitting diodes, display technologies, phosphors, nuclear reactors, bioimaging, and anti-counterfeiting applications has led to increased production, consumption, and environmental release. Consequently, Eu(III) contamination has emerged as an environmental concern, particularly in wastewater from the mining, metallurgical, electronics, pharmaceutical, and nuclear industries. Although stable europium generally exhibits limited toxicity, significant human health and environmental risks are associated with radioactive isotopes such as 152Eu and 154Eu, which are released during nuclear activities. In addition, the persistence, mobility, bioaccumulation potential, and interactions of Eu(III) with aquatic systems may affect microbial communities, nutrient cycling, aquatic organism development, and the overall water quality. This review critically examines the sources, environmental fate, toxicological effects, and treatment technologies of europium-contaminated wastewater. Particular attention is given to advanced removal and recovery methods, including adsorption, membrane filtration, precipitation, solvent extraction, ion exchange, electrochemical processes, and photocatalytic treatment. Recent developments in composite adsorbents, nanostructured materials, metal–organic frameworks, functionalized biochars, and hybrid systems have been evaluated for removal performance, selectivity, regeneration, scalability, and cost-effectiveness. Technological innovations, resource recovery strategies, circular economy approaches, key challenges, research gaps, and future directions for sustainable Eu management are also discussed.","datePublished":"2026-09-14T00:00:00Z","dateModified":"2026-09-14T00:00:00Z","pageStart":"1","pageEnd":"49","sameAs":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s11270-026-09956-6","keywords":["Adsorption","Circular economy","Environmental toxicity","Europium (III)","Radioactive isotopes","Rare-earth elements","Resource recovery","Wastewater treatment","Environment","general","Water Quality/Water Pollution","Atmospheric Protection/Air Quality Control/Air Pollution","Soil Science & Conservation","Hydrogeology","Climate Change/Climate Change Impacts"],"image":["https://media.springernature.com/lw1200/springer-static/image/art%3A10.1007%2Fs11270-026-09956-6/MediaObjects/11270_2026_9956_Fig1_HTML.png","https://media.springernature.com/lw1200/springer-static/image/art%3A10.1007%2Fs11270-026-09956-6/MediaObjects/11270_2026_9956_Fig2_HTML.jpg","https://media.springernature.com/lw1200/springer-static/image/art%3A10.1007%2Fs11270-026-09956-6/MediaObjects/11270_2026_9956_Fig3_HTML.png","https://media.springernature.com/lw1200/springer-static/image/art%3A10.1007%2Fs11270-026-09956-6/MediaObjects/11270_2026_9956_Fig4_HTML.png","https://media.springernature.com/lw1200/springer-static/image/art%3A10.1007%2Fs11270-026-09956-6/MediaObjects/11270_2026_9956_Fig5_HTML.jpg","https://media.springernature.com/lw1200/springer-static/image/art%3A10.1007%2Fs11270-026-09956-6/MediaObjects/11270_2026_9956_Fig6_HTML.jpg","https://media.springernature.com/lw1200/springer-static/image/art%3A10.1007%2Fs11270-026-09956-6/MediaObjects/11270_2026_9956_Fig7_HTML.png"],"isPartOf":{"name":"Water, Air, & Soil Pollution","issn":["1573-2932","0049-6979"],"volumeNumber":"237","@type":["Periodical","PublicationVolume"]},"publisher":{"name":"Springer International Publishing","logo":{"url":"https://www.springernature.com/app-sn/public/images/logo-springernature.png","@type":"ImageObject"},"@type":"Organization"},"author":[{"name":"Youssef Miyah","affiliation":[{"name":"Higher School of Technology, Sidi Mohamed Ben Abdellah University","address":{"name":"Laboratory of Materials, Processes, Catalysis, Agri-Food, and Environment, Higher School of Technology, Sidi Mohamed Ben Abdellah University, Fez, Morocco","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"},{"name":"Higher Institute of Nursing Professions and Health Techniques","address":{"name":"Ministry of Health and Social Protection, Higher Institute of Nursing Professions and Health Techniques, Fez, Morocco","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"@type":"Person"},{"name":"Mohammed Benjelloun","affiliation":[{"name":"Higher School of Technology, Sidi Mohamed Ben Abdellah University","address":{"name":"Laboratory of Materials, Processes, Catalysis, Agri-Food, and Environment, Higher School of Technology, Sidi Mohamed Ben Abdellah University, Fez, Morocco","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"email":"mohammed.benjelloun94@gmail.com","@type":"Person"},{"name":"Jordana Georgin","affiliation":[{"name":"Universidad de La Costa, CUC","address":{"name":"Department of Civil and Environmental, Universidad de La Costa, CUC, Barranquilla, Colombia","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"@type":"Person"},{"name":"Dison S. P. Franco","affiliation":[{"name":"Universidad de La Costa, CUC","address":{"name":"Department of Civil and Environmental, Universidad de La Costa, CUC, Barranquilla, Colombia","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"@type":"Person"},{"name":"Samia Elouali","affiliation":[{"name":"University of Mons (UMONS","address":{"name":"Laboratory of Polymeric and Composite Materials (LPCM), Center of Innovation and Research in Materials and Polymers (CIRMAP), University of Mons (UMONS, Mons, Belgium","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"},{"name":"Cadi Ayyad University","address":{"name":"Laboratory of Water, Biodiversity and Climate Change, Faculty of Science, Semlalia, Cadi Ayyad University, Marrakech, Morocco","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"@type":"Person"},{"name":"Smail Manyani","affiliation":[{"name":"University Hassan II - Casablanca","address":{"name":"Laboratory of Chemistry-Physics and Biotechnology of Biomolecules and Materials, Faculty of Sciences and Techniques of Mohammedia, University Hassan II - Casablanca, Casablanca, Morocco","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"@type":"Person"},{"name":"Ashraf M. Al-Msiedeen","affiliation":[{"name":"College of Science, Imam Mohammad Ibn Saud Islamic University (IMSIU)","address":{"name":"Department of Chemistry, College of Science, Imam Mohammad Ibn Saud Islamic University (IMSIU), Riyadh, Saudi Arabia","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"@type":"Person"},{"name":"Noureddine El Messaoudi","affiliation":[{"name":"College of Science, Imam Mohammad Ibn Saud Islamic University (IMSIU)","address":{"name":"Department of Chemistry, College of Science, Imam Mohammad Ibn Saud Islamic University (IMSIU), Riyadh, Saudi Arabia","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"email":"NElmessaoudi@imamu.edu.sa","@type":"Person"}],"isAccessibleForFree":false,"hasPart":{"isAccessibleForFree":false,"cssSelector":".main-content","@type":"WebPageElement"},"@type":"ScholarlyArticle"},"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"WebPage"}</script>

        
        
