" data-track-action="open author" data-track-index="8_8" data-track-context="researcher popup with no profile" href="#auth-Noureddine-El_Messaoudi-Aff7" data-author-popup="auth-Noureddine-El_Messaoudi-Aff7" data-track-label="Noureddine El Messaoudi" data-author-search="El Messaoudi, Noureddine" data-corresp-id="c2">Noureddine El Messaoudi<svg width="16" height="16" focusable="false" role="img" aria-hidden="true" class="u-icon"><use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="#icon-eds-i-mail-medium"></use></svg></a><sup class="u-js-hide"><a href="#Aff7">7</a></sup> </li></ul><button aria-expanded="false" class="c-article-author-list__button"><svg width="16" height="16" focusable="false" role="img" aria-hidden="true" class="u-icon"><use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="#icon-eds-i-chevron-down-medium"></use></svg><span>Show authors</span></button>
                        
    


